# tesr_zlac_hardware — ZLTECH hub motor driver for ros2_control

Drives the wheels of **{{ d.meta.name }}** through a ZLTECH ZLAC dual-channel servo driver (RS485, Modbus RTU,
velocity mode). Generated by TESR Robot Builder; used automatically by `robot.launch.py hardware:=real`.

